Rule 8 (if both are non-scalars, their trailing dimensions must match)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if (ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ ndim(v_2) > 0) then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1)
